  "full_text": "Finish with... How does it go? This is what you sing if you're a loser and you're not Terry. Because, like, this is... Finish with... Fucking A. You can't fucking sing it. You can't sing it and play the drums. That's what the problem is. Finish with my woman because she couldn't help me with my mind. Let's see. This is the winner song that's a loser. Because... I'm trying to explain it. Okay, let's see. I need the lyrics. Shit. And I'm going to do it bitching. Staring into the... Staring into the camera. And then I'll play some drums just to... Can you see me now? One. Two. Finished with my woman cause she couldn't help me with my mind. People think I'm insane because I am frowning all the... Okay. You know what? You gotta sing it like with some heart, you know what I'm saying? That's what Tom McCarty's dad taught me. Finished with my woman cause she couldn't help me with my mind. People think I'm insane because I am frowning all the time. All day long I think of things and nothing seems to satisfy. Think I'll lose my mind if I don't find something to pacify. Can you help me occupy my brain? Oh yeah. I need someone to show me the things in life that I can't find. I can't see things that make true happiness. I must be blind. Make a joke and I will sigh and you will laugh and I will cry. Happiness I cannot feel and love to me is so unreal So as you hear these words telling you now of my state I tell you to enjoy life I wish I could but it's too late",
